<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/29/eng@/~part_II__cl_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/29/eng@/~part_II__cl_3__subsec_8> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/29/eng@> .
