<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/29/eng@> <https://schema.org/name> "Perbadanan Pembangunan Bandar (Successor Company) Bill 1995"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1995/29/eng@> .
